+# Portfolio task verification — 24 October 2026
+
+> Packaging note (25 October 2026): This report retains its dated local verification and prior-work attribution. Raw logs, screenshots, traces and machine receipts remain locally retained, not newly published CI evidence. The [sanitised summary](evidence/portfolio-reviewed-source-2026-10-25.md) records the carried hashes, source equivalence, current canonical health and packaging checks. This isolated branch has not rerun the application tests or build. The [later bundled UI report](portfolio-clerk-ui-verification-2026-10-24.md) supersedes this baseline’s ten Clerk HTML errors.
